<span id="S4.T3.5.12.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T3.5.12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Total pipeline bubble time on device <math id="S4.T3.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T3.5.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T3.5.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><math id="S4.T3.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{OverlapTime}(d)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>OverlapTime</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{OverlapTime}(d)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T3.5.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">
<span id="S4.T3.5.13.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T3.5.13.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Time overlap on device <math id="S4.T3.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 1</span>: Given a model partition, each stage is assigned a different number and type of layers, each associated with profiled computation and memory costs. The total computation and memory cost of a stage is determined by accumulating the cost of executing a specific computation type (e.g., <math id="S4.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>F</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math>, or <math id="S4.SS2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math>) across all layers assigned to that stage.</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 2</span>: Given a model placement, the computation and memory cost of each device is obtained by summing the costs of all stages assigned to it. In addition, communication time and the overlapping time between communication and computation are considered, both of which are determined by the workload scheduling results.</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 3</span>: Given the model partition, model placement, and workload scheduling results, Pipeline Performance Model simulates the execution behavior of each device and identifies when and where device idle time (BubbleTime(<math id="S4.SS2.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>)) occurs, and detects opportunities where communication can be overlapped with computation (OverlapTime(<math id="S4.SS2.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>)). Based on the simulation results, Pipeline Performance Model provides feedback for Pipeline Generator (§<a href="#S4.SS3" title="4.3. Pipeline Generator ‣ 4. AdaPtis Design ‣ AdaPtis: Reducing Pipeline Bubbles with Adaptive Pipeline Parallelism on Heterogeneous Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a>) to refine model partition, model placement, and workload scheduling, thereby reducing pipeline bubbles and increasing overlap time.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Pipeline Performance Model</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> <span id="alg1.l1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Pipeline conf., Training conf., Profiled data.</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> List of <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{d},M_{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{d},M_{d}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">/* Step 1: Layer-level cost aggregation */</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each stage <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span> <span id="alg1.l4.5" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Model Partition</span>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{s}\leftarrow\sum\limits_{l\in\text{Layers}(s)}\text{ProfiledCompCost}(l)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.111em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mtext>Layers</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><mtext>ProfiledCompCost</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{s}\leftarrow\sum\limits_{l\in\text{Layers}(s)}\text{ProfiledCompCost}(l)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
